      <activity id="b0201909-fa5b-5b92-9ada-b17f5362e34c" activityNameId="962b6f8d-2292-55c6-a81c-20342e63e9f8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Charger</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Charger
 Level 2 charger for BEV. From https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0. Used for overnight charging. Can charge a regular passenger car in 3 hours. Assumed lifetime of 24 years. We upscale it to a 100 kW Level-3 charger by upscaling the charger component given a mass of 1290 kg given by AAB's 100 kW bus charger. Original source: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0. UUID: a123b7b4-2c1f-3777-a2b9-5d29f705f398
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Level 2 charger for BEV. From https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0. Used for overnight charging. Can charge a regular passenger car in 3 hours. Assumed lifetime of 24 years. We upscale it to a 100 kW Level-3 charger by upscaling the charger component given a mass of 1290 kg given by AAB's 100 kW bus charger. Original source: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0
Time period: Base technology year of 2020
Production volume: Unspecified
Sampling: Unspecified
Extrapolations: Unspecified
Uncertainty adjustments: Unspecified
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a123b7b4-2c1f-3777-a2b9-5d29f705f398.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
